# Kambal, Profiteering Mayor (CR 603.2c, 707.2, 614.1c): Bot2 casts Dragon Fodder, two Goblin tokens enter together, and Bot1 gets
# one tapped token copy for each of them (two, not one for the batch). The copies are tokens Bot1 controls entering, so the second
# ability drains once for the batch: Bot2 20 -> 19, Bot1 20 -> 21.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Kambal, Profiteering Mayor
Island
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Dragon Fodder
Island x30

